# --- Personal planning docs (kept local, not committed) ---
# Same convention as every other project on this host: agent instructions and
# planning docs never go to the forge. Never remove these entries.
# Exception: ROADMAP.md IS tracked — its history (what was planned, when it
# shipped or was dropped) has proven useful. `docs/*` rather than `docs/`, because
# git cannot re-include a file inside an ignored directory.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
docs/*
!docs/ROADMAP.md
.claude/

